# Alpha Miner Pro V4.0 - Development Guidelines
- Current Version: V4.0 (Institutional Rebalancing & Bulk Scanning)
- Critical Rule: NEVER execute a trade if Market Impact > 1.5%.
- SMC Logic: Reference 'institutional_enhancements.py' for Fair Value Gaps and Order Blocks.
- Rebalancing: Trim positions back to 10% if they exceed 20% of the portfolio. 
- Principal Harvesting: Sell initial principal if a stock hits +100% (2-bagger).
- Metal Rotation: Automatically apply +10 Alpha if GSR > 80 (pulled via yfinance).
